# Production build target: cPanel (Tremhost).
# cPanel refuses subdomains on temp domains, so the API gets its own temp
# domain with a Python app at URI / (see DEPLOY_CPANEL.md); the frontend
# lives in public_html of the main temp domain. Rebuild + re-upload dist/
# whenever this changes (Vite bakes it in at build time). Switch both to
# https:// once AutoSSL is active, otherwise browsers flag the sign-in form.
VITE_AGRISHIELD_API_URL=http://diplomatic-onyx-antelope.172-93-106-10.cpanel.site
